Lean 4.35 port (changes to third-party files, each marked by a comment at the change)
  Hunter/ProofsGreedy.lean, Hunter/ProofsGreedy2.lean: `simp` in place of a `show`/`rw` that no
    longer matches.
  PreimageChain/ChainGraph.lean: two `simpa` steps take `Finset.mem_sdiff` explicitly and unfold `F`.
  PreimageChain/ComponentGeometry.lean: `simp only [Finset.mem_filter]` before unfolding `IsDoor`.
  PreimageChain/PortalCoordinates.lean: the `Fintype` instance of `PortalOrientation` written out in
    place of `deriving Fintype`.

Other changes
  LowerBounds/SSearch.lean: the local macro `sel(c, a, b)` is a local notation with the same expansion,
    since the Almanac's rules for native_decide proofs exclude macros. The change is Jakub Halfar's, from
    his Almanac batch for 8 symbols (https://github.com/jhalfar/superpermutation-almanac-lean, commit
    7e6664d7b15ed56580cb51cafd8354c3b26a20b9); the file says so at its top.
